  "worked_solution": "To plot a point with coordinates $(-3,-1),$ we start at the origin, move $3$ units left, and then $1$ unit down. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/9ed70a2f54c40a9d9c8879f5dc8a3114db66b5b0bfb6e497fc0ec8c7a9aac92c.png)\n\nSo the correct diagram is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/a87038ed9828e07b0de813c728bf241fb06cde82ecbbb528e5a3f29c972b4e3b.png)",
